# Elbe_viruses
Scripts used for data analysis described in the manuscript: 
Gołębiowska J, Woodhouse JN, Tobias-Hünefeldt SP, Grossart H.0.Salinity-driven niche partitioning of aquatic viruses in one of Europe’s largest estuaries. Appl Environ Microbiol0:e00807-26.https://doi.org/10.1128/aem.00807-26
data/drep_virus_all.zip - dereplicated medium and above quality VIBRANT detected viral sequences 